*Status:* _WIP_

_Soap Glider_ is a precision platformer inspired by the classic Android game _Run_. It's an infinite runner (a forward scroller) where you steer with the mouse and try not to fall off the platforms. You can also do spins in the air. I called it Soap Glider because my younger brother saw me playing it and noted that the character looked like a soap.

#html.video(controls: true, width: 1280, height: 720, src: "/soap-glider-video.mp4")

I worked on this for 11 months in 2024/2025, then I put it on the shelf temporarily, to work on smaller things until I have enough experience.

#html.video(controls: true, width: 1280, height: 720, src: "/soap-glider-video-2.mp4")

This was the first game I made that used ray-tracing. It was also the first game that was fun enough that I think I could play it for hours.
